(Multi-Agent Architecture & Mathematical Scoring) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -18 Td
(Section 2: The 5 Logical Agents, Scoring Formula, and Safety Veto) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Infosys Springboard Internship Technical Documentation - Page 2) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 12 Tf
0 -18 Td
(1. The Five Logical Evaluation Agents) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -14 Td
(- Agent 1: Supervisor / Orchestrator: Manages workflow queues, breaks text into atomic claims, coordinates FAISS evidence retrieval, and schedules parallel judge invocations.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Agent 2: Relevance Judge \(Weight: 20%\): Checks prompt-response intent alignment without drift \(Score: 0.0 to 5.0\).) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Agent 3: Accuracy Judge \(Weight: 30%\): Cross-examines decomposed claims against retrieved evidence passages \(Score: 0.0 to 5.0\).) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Agent 4: Hallucination Sentinel \(Weight: 25%\): Identifies ungrounded or contradicted claims across 4 scientific categories \(Score: 0.0 to 5.0\).) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Agent 5: Completeness Judge \(Weight: 25%\): Detects omissions, missing dimensions, and unaddressed requirements \(Score: 0.0 to 5.0\).) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Verdict Aggregator Engine: Synthesizes all dimension scores into a 0-100 composite score and applies verdict gates.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 12 Tf
0 -18 Td
(2. The 4 Scientific Claim Categories) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -14 Td
(- Supported \(Green\): The claim is directly confirmed by retrieved reference passages.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Unsupported \(Amber\): The available reference text does not mention the fact \(missing evidence\). Crucial rule: Missing evidence is not assumed to be false without contradiction.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Contradicted \(Red\): Reliable reference documentation directly conflicts with or disproves the claim.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Inconclusive \(Slate\): The statement is ambiguous, vague, or lacks context for high-confidence attribution.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 12 Tf
0 -18 Td
(3. Composite Formula & Non-Linear Safety Veto) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -14 Td
(The composite score is calculated using the weighted equation:) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -4 Td
(Score = \(0.20 * Relevance + 0.30 * Accuracy + 0.25 * Hallucination + 0.25 *) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Completeness\) * 20) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -4 Td
(Verdict Gates: PASS \(Score >= 80%\), NEEDS IMPROVEMENT \(60% to 79%\), FAIL \(< 60%\).) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -4 Td
(CRITICAL SAFETY VETO: If any factual claim is classified as Contradicted in high-risk) Tj
0 -12 Td
(domains \(medical, financial, compliance\), the system issues an automatic FAIL verdict) Tj
0 -12 Td
(regardless of the weighted average.) Tj
0 -12 Td
0 -4 Td
ET
endstream
