(Overview of the 8 Dedicated Routes) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -14 Td
(- 1. Dashboard \(/dashboard\): Executive monitoring center with 4 KPI cards, evaluation volume area chart, verdict distribution donut, dimension score comparisons, score range histogram, and recent audit table.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 2. Evaluate Response \(/evaluate\): Primary working form. Takes question, AI response, gold reference, and document upload. Includes 3 pre-configured demo presets and real-time 9-stage progress animation.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 3. Evaluation Results \(/evaluations/:id\): Deep-dive audit report. Displays large overall score \(0-100\), verdict badge, 4 dimension score cards, claim-level table with color badges, expandable evidence drawer, agent reasoning traces, and printable PDF export.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 4. Evaluation History \(/history\): Searchable audit archive with sorting, pagination, multi-filtering \(verdict, score, hallucination status\), side-by-side comparison modal for 2 evaluations, and CSV export.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 5. Agent Architecture \(/agents\): Interactive topology map illustrating the end-to-end evaluation flow. Clicking any agent opens prompt templates, input/output schemas, latency metrics, and tech stack telemetry.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 6. Knowledge Base \(/knowledge-base\): Manages trusted reference documents. Displays document chunks, vector previews, upload modal, and an Evidence Retrieval Playground to test FAISS cosine similarity.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 7. Analytics & Reports \(/analytics\): Analytics workspace with 6 Recharts graphs analyzing evaluation throughput, dimension trends, claim distribution, and multi-agent latency benchmarks.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- 8. Batch Evaluation \(/batch-evaluation\): Dataset auditing at scale. Supports CSV upload, downloadable sample CSV template, schema validation, live execution simulation, and results export.) Tj
0 -13 Td
ET
